{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eletar Hero 2 is the sequel to the 2D platformer &quot;Eletar Hero&quot; and follows the events after the failure of Mr Steven's first plan. The Hero (Aaron Speed) is met with more like him who were chosen by the Eletar. They have chosen to work with or against Mr Stevens in his second and bigger plan to take over the world. Aaron and his new allies must find out and stop Mr Stevens' plan, while having to fight new superpowered foes, and find the professor; so Aaron can finally find out why he was chosen and what these abilities mean for him.  <br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters with different movement and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse around 11 different maze-like levels for each character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Bosses with different abilities and fighting styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden abilities the Eletar have left behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ally support system</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925020?t=1765264605","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925020/c9700bbabad8e8f2906546c60a76cee13dbdfb37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765264605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925020/40139176fe4a54597d149f9b38d7d2464c8a74a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765264605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925020/40139176fe4a54597d149f9b38d7d2464c8a74a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765264605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_de